+# F-25: Tend UI Print Action
+
+## Result
+
+The toolbar print action now renders through an isolated Tend UI adapter:
+
+```text
+src/integrations/tend-ui/print-button.jsx
+```
+
+The adapter uses `@10d/tend-ui/primitives/Button` and the packaged Tend UI `Print` icon. It preserves the stable `#js-print-btn` selector so the existing vanilla handler remains the owner of the action.
+
+## Preserved Product Contract
+
+- the control remains an icon-only `40 x 40` button;
+- accessible name and tooltip remain `Печать`;
+- clicking shows `Подготовка к печати...` in the existing global toast;
+- the control stays in the toolbar in card and table views;
+- the complete React mount moves to `#js-header-actions` in a custom-group view;
+- React does not own toast state, task state, filters or navigation.
+
+## Implementation Boundary
+
+`index.html` contains only `#tend-ui-print-root`. `src/main.js` mounts the Tend UI control before `initPrintAction()` attaches the existing click listener. `tasks-view.js` moves the mount node rather than moving React-owned children.
+
+The adapter contains no call to `showToast` and no product-state mutation. Removing this adapter and restoring the former HTML button is an independent rollback.
+
